      "title": {
        "text": "Logistics and Site Preparation",
        "sources": [
          "R1",
          "R10",
          "R15"
        ]
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The gallery inspection confirmed the loading door is wide enough for the largest crate and the lift is functional.",
          "sources": [
            "R1"
          ],
          "kind": "point",
          "owner": null,
          "due": null
        },
        {
          "text": "The entrance includes a bench beside the coat hooks; the room felt welcoming during the trial.",
          "sources": [
            "R10"
          ],
          "kind": "point",
          "owner": null,
          "due": null
        },
        {
          "text": "The floor plan shows the bench and both exits; photographs made the entrance look narrower than it is, but the measured inspection is complete.",
          "sources": [
            "R15"
          ],
          "kind": "point",
          "owner": null,
          "due": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": {
        "text": "Artwork and Documentation",
        "sources": [
          "R0",
          "R7",
          "R8",
          "R9"
        ]
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Priya will book the artwork courier by Thursday once the insurance certificate is approved.",
          "sources": [
            "R0"
          ],
          "kind": "action",
          "owner": "Priya",
          "due": "Thursday"
        },
        {
          "text": "The print estimate for a large catalogue exceeds the budget; the team decided to limit the printed catalogue to 100 copies and provide a QR link for others.",
          "sources": [
            "R7",
            "R8"
          ],
          "kind": "decision",
          "owner": null,
          "due": null
        },
        {
          "text": "The catalogue PDF and QR link already exist and function correctly; the printed and digital copies contain the same artist descriptions.",
          "sources": [
            "R9"
          ],
          "kind": "point",
          "owner": null,
          "due": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": {
        "text": "Visitor Experience and Artist Input",
        "sources": [
          "R2",
          "R5",
          "R6",
          "R11",
          "R17"
        ]
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lena noted the lighting was softer in the afternoon than in morning photographs.",
          "sources": [
            "R2"
          ],
          "kind": "point",
          "owner": null,
          "due": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Trial visitors showed varied preferences, such as reading alone or discussing work with friends.",
          "sources": [
            "R5"
          ],
          "kind": "point",
          "owner": null,
          "due": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Artists provided varied descriptions for their works, differing in tone and focus.",
          "sources": [
            "R6"
          ],
          "kind": "point",
          "owner": null,
          "due": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Artists expressed a range of emotions, from pride to uncertainty, regarding their work's reception.",
          "sources": [
            "R11"
          ],
          "kind": "point",
          "owner": null,
          "due": null
        },
        {
          "text": "The preview was encouraging as visitors noticed details the artists had not expected others to notice.",
          "sources": [
            "R17"
          ],
          "kind": "point",
          "owner": null,
          "due": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": {
        "text": "Internal Coordination and Offers",
        "sources": [
          "R3",
          "R4",
          "R12",
          "R13",
          "R16",
          "R18",
          "R19"
        ]
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omar offered to record a narrated audio tour; the offer remains unaccepted and is not a current task.",
          "sources": [
            "R4",
            "R16"
          ],
          "kind": "point",
          "owner": null,
          "due": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Priya's previous commitment to replace the camera equipment list is withdrawn as the folder already contains the corrected list.",
          "sources": [
            "R12"
          ],
          "kind": "decision",
          "owner": null,
          "due": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Priya will send the existing floor plan to Lena by Thursday for use in visitor conversations.",
          "sources": [
            "R18"
          ],
          "kind": "action",
          "owner": "Priya",
          "due": "Thursday"
        }
      ]
